OL,3,GNEWSAForgotten city clock set for
OL,4,ALondon museum loan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA clock renowned for its accuracy could
OL,7,Fbe moved from Norwich to a London
OL,8,Fmuseum for about a decade.
OL,10,FThe Gurney Clock is considered a
OL,11,Fnationally significant heritage asset
OL,12,Fbut since 2015, it has been kept in
OL,13,Fstorage out of view from the public.
OL,15,FThe device was created in the 1970s to
OL,16,Fcelebrate the 200th anniversary of
OL,17,FNorwich-based Gurney Bank, which later
OL,18,Fbecame Barclays, and was given as a
OL,19,Fgift to the people of the city.
