OL,3,GNEWSAForgotten city clock set for
OL,4,ALondon museum loan
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorwich City Council, which owns it, is
OL,7,Fconsidering loaning it to London
OL,8,FScience Museum's Clockmakers Museum for
OL,9,Fa 10-year period, where it will be
OL,10,Frestored.
